-- src:171 | Tuy nhiên, Bảo Minh sẽ không chịu trách nhiệm đối với:

-- (a) the deductible: arithmetic, in `Section I — the indemnity for the occurrence` below.
-- (b) consequential loss of every kind, including penalties, delay, failure to perform and
-- loss of contract: Section I never pays it, whatever the cause.
