GIVETH A NUMBER
`Section I exclusion (b) — the part of the consequential losses claimed that Section I pays` c MEANS
    0

-- (c) loss due to faulty design: the whole loss, with no carve-back (contrast (d)).
-- src:179 | c) Những tổn thất do thiết kế sai;
