GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Section I exclusion (c) — loss due to faulty design` l MEANS
    elem `faulty design` (l's `the causes`)

-- (d) the cost of replacing, repairing or rectifying defective material or workmanship,
-- limited to the items directly affected; loss to other items from an accident caused by
-- the defect is not excluded. Read with "hạng mục" as a component, so what is taken out is
-- the cost of putting right the defective work itself (fork F22). On the reading that
-- "hạng mục" keeps its Schedule meaning (General Condition 2), the whole loss to the item
-- would go (finding X14, bmcar-findings.l4).
