@ref Section I exclusion (d), lines 181-184
GIVEN l IS A `A loss to an item`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Section I exclusion (d) — the cost of rectifying the defective material or workmanship` l MEANS
    l's `of which, replacing, repairing or rectifying defective material or workmanship`

-- (e) corrosion, wear, oxidation, deterioration due to lack of use or normal pressure and
-- temperature. Taken as one cause, the qualifier reaching all four (fork F23).
-- src:186 | e) Ăn mòn, mài mòn, ô xy hoá, mục rữa do ít sử dụng hay do điều kiện áp suất, nhiệt độ
-- src:187 | bình thường;
@ref Section I exclusion (e), lines 186-187
GIVEN l IS A `A loss to an item`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Section I exclusion (e) — corrosion, wear, oxidation or deterioration` l MEANS
    elem `corrosion, wear, oxidation or deterioration due to lack of use or normal pressure and temperature` (l's `the causes`)

-- (f) mechanical and/or electrical breakdown or derangement of construction plant,
-- equipment and machinery. Read as the breakdown of the plant itself: a loss to plant that
-- consists in its own breakdown. Damage the breakdown does to other property is not
-- reached (fork F24).
-- src:189 | f) Đổ vỡ cơ học và/hoặc do điện hay do sự trục trặc của các trang thiết bị và máy móc xây
-- src:190 | dựng;
