GIVEN l IS A `A loss to an item`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Section I exclusion (f) — breakdown of construction plant, equipment or machinery` l MEANS
        l's `what the property is` EQUALS `construction plant, equipment or machinery`
    AND elem `mechanical or electrical breakdown or derangement of construction plant, equipment or machinery` (l's `the causes`)

-- (g) motor vehicles licensed for public roads, ships and barges.
-- src:192 | g) Mất mát hay thiệt hại đối với xe cơ giới được phép sử dụng trên đường công cộng hay
-- src:193 | đối với tàu thuỷ hoặc xà lan;
@ref Section I exclusion (g), lines 192-193
GIVEN l IS A `A loss to an item`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Section I exclusion (g) — vehicles licensed for public roads, ships and barges` l MEANS
    CONSIDER l's `what the property is`
    WHEN `a motor vehicle licensed for use on public roads` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a ship`                                          THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a barge`                                         THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

-- (h) files, drawings, accounting records, bills, cash, stamps, documents, evidences of
-- debt, share certificates, letters of guarantee, cheques.
